<decision #track.support-manual-ai-data-workflow-node-policy.authoring-field apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M0NJZ4TDCED2S6PG7PS6E445>
  How should canonical XNL distinguish manual policy from legacy implementation type?
  </?01M0NJZ4TDCED2S6PG7PS6E445>
